{
  "verdict": "revise",
  "issues": [
    "Scope: The question asked for the raw difference in conversion rates (email minus paid_search). The answer reports an adjusted, weighted effect (-0.2178) instead of the required raw difference (0.0698).",
    "Overreach: The answer presents the adjusted weighted effect as a causal estimate of the campaign’s impact, despite the channel not being randomly assigned and only one confounder being adjusted for.",
    "Overreach: The conclusion states the email campaign “did not improve conversion” based on the adjusted estimate, which is a causal claim not justified by the observational data."
  ]
}
